<!-- CONTACT HERO -->

<section class="contact-hero">

  <div class="eyebrow">
    Loving Longmont
  </div>

  <h1>We'd Love to Hear From You</h1>

  <p>
    Loving Longmont is about our community. Whether you have
    something happening around town, know a business we should
    discover, have a photograph or story to share, or simply
