      </p>

    </div>



    <div class="option">

      <div class="option-icon">🏪</div>

      <h3>Local Businesses</h3>

      <p>
        Own or know a great Longmont business?
        Send us the details so we can learn more
        about them.
      </p>

    </div>



    <div class="option">

      <div class="option-icon">📸</div>

      <h3>Photos & Stories</h3>

      <p>
        Share photographs, local stories,
        community news or something that shows
        what you love about Longmont.
      </p>

    </div>


  </div>

</div>



<!-- MORE OPTIONS -->

<div class="more-options">


  <div class="small-option">

    <span>💼</span>

    <h3>Job Openings</h3>

    <p>
      Is your Longmont business hiring?
      Send us information about the opportunity.
    </p>

  </div>



  <div class="small-option">

    <span>⭐</span>

    <h3>Suggest a Spotlight</h3>

    <p>
      Know a business, organization or person
      doing something great in Longmont?
      Tell us about them.
    </p>

  </div>



  <div class="small-option">

    <span>💡</span>

    <h3>Suggestions</h3>

    <p>
      Have an idea that would make Loving Longmont
      more useful to our community? We want to hear it.
    </p>

  </div>


</div>

</section>



<!-- COMMUNITY MESSAGE -->

<section class="community">

<div class="community-content">

  <div class="eyebrow">
    Community Helping Community
  </div>

  <h2>Longmont Belongs to All of Us</h2>

  <p>
    Loving Longmont is built around the people who live,
    work, create, shop, explore and build community here.
    If there's something you think Longmont should know about,
    help us discover it.
  </p>

</div>

</section>



